<!--
    The Catimo mark as a notification small icon. D-072.

    Android draws this as a mask: it keeps the alpha, throws the colour away and
    applies its own tint. So this is the same silhouette as
    [ic_launcher_monochrome], which was drawn on that rule, with the path data
    copied verbatim rather than re-exported, so the two cannot drift in shape.

    Only the frame differs. The themed layer is a 108dp adaptive icon whose art
    sits inside the safe zone and spans about 52 units; a notification icon is
    24dp with its art filling about 22 of them. The outer group scales the
    inner one 1.9x about the centre, which lands the mark at that size without
    touching a coordinate.
-->
